{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"一种郑重的期待已经成立，同时又有明显的悬而未决：不是迟疑要不要靠近，而是已经认真起来，却还没有得到足以让人安心的东西。\",\"thread\":\"眼前的东西已经重要到不能随便对待，所以期待不是轻松的好奇；但此刻又还没有任何实际获得可以支撑确信。认真已经发生，满足和把握却都还没有发生，这使期待本身带着分量，也带着未落实的紧张。\",\"used\":\"无\",\"new\":[\"这件事从一开始就被当作值得认真对待的东西，吸引并不是轻飘的。\",\"目前还没有实际的满足或把握，因此期待中保留着真实的悬念。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5e43953a-4cc4-4096-981a-192095b6a27d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215630088346Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.719, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T21:57:07.804020+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5a9b0f06042dd9a094a686d01e2658ab3488c8afb35a04654c6af5b9415a7382", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directo